# Tempest Almanac Support

Thank you for using Tempest Almanac.

Tempest Almanac is an independent app designed for owners of a Tempest Weather System. The app uses your Tempest Personal Access Token to retrieve and display weather data from your own station.

## Getting Started

When you first open Tempest Almanac, you can connect your Tempest Weather System using your Personal Access Token.

If you would like to explore the app without connecting a Tempest station, select **Try Demo** to use Demo Mode.

## Troubleshooting

If Tempest Almanac is unable to retrieve your weather data:

- Verify that your Tempest Personal Access Token is correct.
- Confirm that your iPhone has an internet connection.
- Confirm that your Tempest station is available through the Tempest service.
- If necessary, reconnect your Tempest account from within the app.

